B=r'''<style>.box p,.box li{font-size:18.5px;line-height:1.25}.box h2{font-size:22.5px;margin-bottom:3px}.tbl{font-size:16px}.tbl th,.tbl td{padding:2px 6px}.iq ol{font-size:18px;line-height:1.24}.pill{font-size:15px}.grid{gap:10px}.handle{bottom:-12px}.box{padding:9px 12px}.tagline{font-size:19px;margin-bottom:9px}.code{font-family:Consolas,'DejaVu Sans Mono',monospace;background:#f1f5f9;border:1px dashed #94a3b8;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 7px;margin:4px 0;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;white-space:pre-wrap;word-break:break-all}</style>
<div class="title">🦺 HxGN EAM Safety &amp; Permit to Work <span class="badge">CHEAT SHEET</span></div>
<div class="tagline">Hazards → precautions → LOTO → permits → PTW. (HxGN EAM Safety Management brief, 12.1)</div>
<div class="grid">
<div class="box c1"><h2>1. Three components</h2><ul><li><b>Safety</b> (hazard + precaution)</li><li><b>Lockout/Tagout</b> (LOTO)</li><li><b>Permitting</b> (permit → permit to work)</li><li>Built for OSHA / EU-OSHA style compliance</li></ul></div>
<div class="box c2"><h2>2. Hazards &amp; Precautions</h2><ul><li>Define each <b>Hazard</b> (HZST) and <b>Precaution</b> (PCST) separately</li><li>Precaution has <b>Timing</b> (before/during/after), <b>Responsibility</b>, review date</li><li>Both under <b>revision control</b>: edit only when <b>Unfinished</b></li><li>Approve → old revision <b>superseded</b></li></ul></div>
<div class="box c3"><h2>3. Safety tabs</h2><ul><li>On Assets, Locations, Categories, PM Schedules, Std WOs, Parts, WOs, PTWs</li><li><b>Apply to Children</b> = inherit down the hierarchy</li><li>Review via <b>e-Signature</b> sets next review date (SAFERFRQ)</li><li>Edit a record → tab goes <b>un-reviewed</b></li></ul></div>
<div class="box c4"><h2>4. Safety Matrix</h2><div class="flow" style="flex-wrap:wrap;row-gap:4px"><span class="pill">Equipment / Class / Category</span><span class="arr">+</span><span class="pill">Activity</span><span class="arr">→</span><span class="pill">Hazard</span></div><ul><li>Activity = PM Schedule, Std WO, Task/Job Plan or <b>Tool</b></li><li>e.g. welding + tank with flammable liquid</li></ul></div>
<div class="box c5"><h2>5. WO auto-population</h2><ul><li>New WO (manual, PM or pattern) <b>copies</b> safety records from equipment, location, parents, parts, Std WO/PM, Safety Matrix</li><li>Nothing is auto-removed: <b>delete manually</b></li><li>WO tab stores hazard + precaution <b>revision</b></li></ul></div>
<div class="box c6"><h2>6. LOTO setup</h2><div class="flow" style="flex-wrap:wrap;row-gap:4px"><span class="pill">Isolation Method (Task)</span><span class="arr">+</span><span class="pill">Isolation Point</span><span class="arr">→</span><span class="pill">LOTO tab</span></div><ul><li>Point has <b>Energy Source</b> (ESRC) + <b>Residual Energy</b> (RSDE)</li><li>LOTO steps flagged <b>Isolation Step</b> or de-isolation; <b>Isolation Type</b> picks the procedure</li></ul></div>
<div class="box c7"><h2>7. Permits &amp; PTW</h2><ul><li><b>Permit</b> = template on the WO; <b>Auto Create PTW</b> needs PTW Type + Risk</li><li><b>LOTO Required</b> copies LOTO from equipment</li><li><b>Mandatory</b> flag; PTWLIMIT = one open PTW per WO</li></ul><div class="code">PTWAUTO=YES → PTW auto-created
PERMCLEA = NO | DEACT | DEL</div></div>
<div class="box c8"><h2>8. PTW lifecycle</h2><div class="flow" style="flex-wrap:wrap;row-gap:4px"><span class="pill">Unfinished</span><span class="arr">→</span><span class="pill">Request Approval</span><span class="arr">→</span><span class="pill">Approved</span><span class="arr">→</span><span class="pill">Active</span><span class="arr">→</span><span class="pill">Expired</span><span class="arr">→</span><span class="pill">Closed</span></div><ul><li>Also <b>Cancelled</b> / <b>Suspended</b></li><li>Duration + <b>Extend</b> (e-Sig) = Valid Until</li></ul></div>
<div class="box c1"><h2>9. Isolated &amp; Lockout Box</h2><ul><li><b>Isolated</b> button (e-Sig) sets flag on PTW + isolation points</li><li><b>Lockout Box</b> → <b>In Use</b> + Current PTW</li><li><b>De-Isolated</b> reverses it</li></ul></div>
<div class="box c2"><h2>10. Conflicts tab</h2><table class="tbl"><tr><th>You pick</th><th>Sister PTW (SYNC)</th></tr><tr><td>Finish After</td><td>Finish Before</td></tr><tr><td>Finish Before</td><td>Finish After</td></tr><tr><td>No Conflict</td><td>No Conflict</td></tr></table><ul><li>PTWCONFL = SYNC or MANUAL</li></ul></div>
<div class="bottom">
<div class="box" style="border-color:#1a5f7a"><h2 style="color:#1a5f7a">Flow</h2><div class="flow" style="flex-wrap:wrap;row-gap:4px"><span class="pill">Hazard</span><span class="arr">→</span><span class="pill">Precaution</span><span class="arr">→</span><span class="pill">WO safety tab</span><span class="arr">→</span><span class="pill">PTW</span><span class="arr">→</span><span class="pill">Isolated</span></div></div>
<div class="box iq"><h2>Consultant tips</h2><ol><li>Set up Isolation Methods before LOTO records</li><li>Review tabs with e-Signature after any change</li><li>Check SAFESYNC / SAFERREV before approving revisions</li></ol></div>
<div class="box" style="border-color:#2d8a5a"><h2 style="color:#2d8a5a">Key points</h2><ul><li>Revision control everywhere</li><li>Permit = template, PTW = live</li><li>Lockout Box tracks In Use</li></ul></div>
</div></div>'''
